# Lost Probe source media. Not referenced by the theme at runtime; only
# banner.png and banner-hero.png in this folder are read. The .avi, the
# two oversized .wmv screen captures, and The_Lost_Probe.exe were purged
# from history with git filter-repo to clear GitHub's 100 MB blob limit.
# Backups live on the user's Desktop, outside the repo.
assets/projects/lost-probe/*.avi
assets/projects/lost-probe/*.wmv
assets/projects/lost-probe/*.exe
